{"name": "Enfant", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Introducing Enfant</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A 3D action-adventure/metroidvania about an elephant looking for his lost herd in the post apocalyptic future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a vibrant, decaying world, uncover remnants of humanity, and interact with a quirky cast of evolved intelligent animals.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Explore a dystopian world shaped by the scars and wreckage of humanity\u2019s last, desperate attempts to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/9bd02cce49b1b0e4e885199913e051a5.poster.avif?t=1765331077\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/9bd02cce49b1b0e4e885199913e051a5.webm?t=1765331077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/9bd02cce49b1b0e4e885199913e051a5.mp4?t=1765331077\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Feel the weight and power of being an elephant. Crumbling walls, heavy obstacles and smaller creatures stand little chance against such strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/c60daa55dd127485d84f49fb223705f2.poster.avif?t=1765331077\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/c60daa55dd127485d84f49fb223705f2.webm?t=1765331077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/c60daa55dd127485d84f49fb223705f2.mp4?t=1765331077\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Manage a novel diegetic backpack system that directly impacts gameplay, depending on its size, what you choose to carry, and how you arrange it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"682\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/c1631a9963685ed0b9a29973d3434a9a.poster.avif?t=1765331077\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/c1631a9963685ed0b9a29973d3434a9a.webm?t=1765331077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/c1631a9963685ed0b9a29973d3434a9a.mp4?t=1765331077\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Encounter a set of evolved animal characters - the enlightened - each either friend, foe or somewhere in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/c257dabb1bdc49d0755662aebca9f93b.poster.avif?t=1765331077\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/c257dabb1bdc49d0755662aebca9f93b.webm?t=1765331077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/c257dabb1bdc49d0755662aebca9f93b.mp4?t=1765331077\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Solve puzzles your way. Use your trunk to soak up water or douse flames, equip tools like machetes and shields, and interact with creatures like frogs, spiders, or crows in emergent, nature-inspired scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/ece8b8c30e5dabc9c11baeecbdea7133.poster.avif?t=1765331077\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/ece8b8c30e5dabc9c11baeecbdea7133.webm?t=1765331077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/extras/ece8b8c30e5dabc9c11baeecbdea7133.mp4?t=1765331077\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Striking a balance between playful and profound, the world of Enfant will continuously shift and reveal itself to you, inviting curiosity, reflection, and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A 3D action-adventure/metroidvania about an elephant looking for his herd. Explore a vibrant, decaying world, uncover remnants of humanity, and interact with a quirky cast of evolved intelligent animals.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025390/6021adb767706ebcf4cd5a2633340a6dfe3e789e/header.jpg?t=1765331077", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Metroidvania", "Action", "Action-Adventure", "3D", "Third Person", "Post-apocalyptic"], "developers": "Zebrar PTY L